  "problemDescription": "8-to-3 one-hot-to-binary priority encoder. y holds the binary index of the set bit in x; defaults to 000 when no bit (or multiple) is set. Reference adds an `AFTER 10 ns` inertial delay on the first two choices to exercise after-delay handling.",
